{
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "thalamus_usage",
    "project": "thalamus"
  },
  "spec": {
    "display": {
      "name": "Thalamus Usage"
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "kind": "TextVariable",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Rate Interval",
            "hidden": false
          },
          "value": "15m",
          "name": "rate_interval"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "TextVariable",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Quantile",
            "hidden": false
          },
          "value": "0.99",
          "name": "quantile"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "TextVariable",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Rate Multiplier (per-second → per-hour = 3600)",
            "hidden": false
          },
          "value": "1",
          "name": "rate_multiplier"
        }
      }
    ],
    "panels": {
      "readme": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "README"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "Markdown",
            "spec": {
              "text": "# Thalamus Usage\n\nShows how clients use Thalamus: request and input/output token volume, and request parameters. Use the SLO dashboard for user-facing latency and the Debug dashboards for deep diagnosis.\n\n## Variables\n\n- `rate_interval` controls the smoothing window for counter rates. Shorter windows expose bursts; longer windows smooth sparse traffic. Does not change the displayed unit. Can't be lower than scrape interval (15s), and values lower than 1m may display inaccurately.\n- `quantile` selects the percentile shown by distribution panels, e.g. 0.99 shows p99 latency.\n- `rate_multiplier` scales counter rates, which Prometheus always returns per second. Use `1` for per-second, `60` for per-minute, or `3600` for per-hour values. Axis labels remain in their default per-second units."
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "success_rate": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Success Rate",
            "description": "Number of successfully completed requests."
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "table",
                "position": "right",
                "size": "small",
                "values": [
                  "last"
                ]
              },
              "visual": {
                "areaOpacity": 0.2,
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineStyle": "solid",
                "lineWidth": 1.5,
                "pointRadius": 2
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "format": {
                  "unit": "decimal"
                },
                "label": "req/s",
                "min": 0,
                "show": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource"
                    },
                    "query": "sum(rate(vllm:request_success_total{finished_reason=~\"stop|length\"}[$rate_interval])) * $rate_multiplier",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "total"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource"
                    },
                    "query": "sum by (model_name) (rate(vllm:request_success_total{finished_reason=~\"stop|length\"}[$rate_interval])) * $rate_multiplier",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{model_name}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
